{"title":"Rose Gold","slug":"Rose_Gold","hero":null,"pageid":674,"revid":20007,"timestamp":"2025-10-11T19:44:00Z","lastEditor":"Seztago","categories":["Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Stone","fields":[{"label":"Stone","value":"$23/stud"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$80/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$120/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.4.1"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"3/10/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Available"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<b>Rose Gold</b> is a light pink colored ore.\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>Rose Gold is relatively uncommon ore, found only in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Blackstone/\">Blackstone</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lavaslate/\">Lavaslate</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Chalkyslate/\">Chalkyslate</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Blueslate/\">Blueslate</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Smokeslate/\">Smokeslate</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Terracotta/\">Terracotta</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Limestone/\">Limestone</a> deposits. However, it is most commonly found in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Terracotta/\">Terracotta</a> deposits in the desert mines.\n</p><p>Note: <b>Rose Gold ore cannot spawn in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Marble/\">Marble</a> deposits as of update 1.67.0.</b>\n</p>"}
